<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-United says mulling funds raising.</title>
<headline>RTRS-United says mulling funds raising.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pay television operator United International Holdings said on Monday it was considering raising up to A$100 million by the end of calendar 1996 to fund the expansion of its Australian regional operations.</p>
<p>United International vice president John Hagans said the funds could be raised in local or international debt or equity markets.</p>
</text>
